Package: sentry-api-scanner
Architecture: all
Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${misc:Depends},
 python3-click,
 python3-yaml,
 python3-requests
Recommends: python3-rich
Description: Silent API security header scanner
 Sentry scans REST, GraphQL, SOAP, gRPC and other API endpoints
 for missing security headers (HSTS, CSP, X-Frame-Options) and
 harmful disclosure headers (Server, X-Powered-By).
 .
 Three scan modes: passive browser interception, active URL list
 scanning, and spider-based API discovery.
